## 2. Safety Protocols

### 2.1 Overview

Safety is a paramount concern at Apex Manufacturing. Our safety protocols are aligned with OSHA (Occupational Safety and Health Administration) standards and include training, equipment safety checks, and emergency procedures.

### 2.2 Employee Training

All employees must undergo safety training, which includes:

- Hazard Communication
- Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) Usage
- Emergency Evacuation Procedures

| Training Type       | Duration          | Frequency         | Responsible Person |
|---------------------|-------------------|-------------------|---------------------|
| General Safety      | 4 hours           | Annually          | Sarah Thompson       |
| Equipment Handling   | 2 hours           | Biannually        | John Carter          |
| Emergency Response   | 3 hours           | Annually          | Safety Committee      |

### 2.3 Equipment Safety Checks

Regular safety checks are performed on all equipment to ensure compliance and functionality:

| Equipment Type      | Check Frequency    | Last Check Date   | Responsible Person |
|---------------------|-------------------|-------------------|---------------------|
| CNC Machines        | Monthly           | 10/01/2023        | Maintenance Team     |
| Forklifts           | Weekly            | 10/05/2023        | Operations Manager   |
| Fire Extinguishers  | Quarterly         | 09/30/2023        | Safety Officer       |

